  "type": "MCQ",
  "question": "Consider the two statements: (I) between any two rational numbers, there is an irrational number; (II) between any two irrational numbers, there is a rational number. Then",
  "options": {
    "A": "both (I) and (II) are true;",
    "B": "(I) is true but (II) is not;",
    "C": "(I) is false but (II) is not;",
    "D": "both (I) and (II) are false."
  },
  "answer": "A",
